  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1500524/description_cda03289-152d-4ac0-91e6-28abf63a6bce.jpg\" alt=\"關於\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"><br><br>此模組新增並改進了 Minecraft 地牢，它們具有不同的稀有度和大小，充滿了原版特殊物品和生物。所有內容均僅使用原版功能構建，意味著<strong>不包含任何自訂方塊或實體。</strong><br>(歡迎加入任何整合包)<br><br>推薦用於減輕延遲的模組：</strong><br>Enhanced Block Entities<br>ImmediatelyFast<br>Sodium<br>Entity Culling<br>FerriteCore<br>Chunky</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1500524/description_ca0e92f9-a895-41ab-85bc-40d44e17f87d.jpg\" alt=\"新聞\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p>✅ 平原地牢<br>✅ 沙漠地牢<br>✅ 雪地地牢</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1500524/description_7edec5b2-7b8f-4149-ab00-9b9b35e3cc1b.jpg\" alt=\"未來計劃\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p>開發中的模組清單：</p>\n<p>✅ Epic Villages<br>✅ Epic Witch huts<br>✅ Epic Dungeons<br>✅ Epic Igloos&nbsp;<br>🟨 Epic Jungle Temples (即將推出)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1500524/description_659de79f-7824-470e-be99-b296c686ed08.jpg\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p><strong>✅ 完全相容</strong><br>&nbsp;<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252funpaid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_5d0091c0-57d5-4bc5-8592-ca850b88254c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"102\"></a><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13)\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://discord.gg/T4xFVm8kct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_88829ca5-d813-4ded-b021-30cf3a70da2c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"104\"></a></span></span></p>",
